					<description><![CDATA[<div id="yui_3_17_2_1_1721024772953_131" class="ProductItem-details-excerpt ProductItem-details-excerpt-below-price" data-content-field="excerpt">
<p class="preFade fadeIn disable-executed-animation"><em>Bursting with fresh lime zest and raspberry aromas, a perfect refreshment for the quintessential Aussie summer. A mild sourness that keeps you coming back for more guaranteed good times!</em></p>
<p class="preFade fadeIn disable-executed-animation"><em>Ingredients: Water, Barley Malt, Hops, Yeast, Raspberries &#38; Lime</em></p>
<p class="preFade fadeIn disable-executed-animation"><em>3.7% ABV &#124; VOL 375ml</em></p>
</div>
