		<item>
		<title>Benbullen 1/8th Grass Fed Beast</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/7890/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[benbullenspeckleparkmeats]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jul 2024 06:37:09 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=7890</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Explore our exclusive offer on an Eighth Beast from Benbullen Farms, featuring a curated selection of premium cuts sourced from our sustainably-raised Speckle Park cattle. This special package provides a taste of our finest meats, perfect for stocking your freezer with high-quality, farm-fresh options. Our Eighth Beast package includes a diverse assortment of cuts such as ribeye steaks, sirloin steaks, roasts, and ground beef, offering versatility for a range of culinary creations.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<h4>Features:</h4>
<ul>
<li>Scotch Fillets</li>
<li>Porterhouse</li>
<li>Rump Steaks</li>
<li>Blade Steaks</li>
<li>Diced Beef</li>
<li>BBQ Steaks</li>
<li>Stewing Steaks</li>
<li>Osso Bucco</li>
<li>Premium Beef Mince</li>
<li>Gourmet and plain snags</li>
<li>Rolled Roast</li>
<li>Silverside</li>
<li>Brisket</li>
<li>Bones</li>
<li>Approx 30kg HCSW</li>
</ul>
<p>&#160;</p>
<h4>Details:</h4>
<ul data-rte-list="default">
<li>
<p class=""><strong>Packaging:</strong> Vacuum-sealed to preserve optimal freshness and convenience.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p class=""><strong>Storage:</strong> Store in your freezer upon delivery and consume within recommended timeframes for the best taste and texture.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="">Indulge in the exceptional flavors of Benbullen Speckle Park Meats. Order your Eighth Beast package today and experience the difference that passion, quality, and sustainability bring to your table.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/7890/">Benbullen 1/8th Grass Fed Beast</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/7890/">Benbullen 1/8th Grass Fed Beast</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
