				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=7893</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p class="">Take advantage of our exclusive offer on a Quarter Beast from Benbullen Farms, featuring a selection of prime cuts sourced from our sustainably-raised Speckle Park cattle. This special bundle allows you to enjoy a variety of premium meats, perfect for stocking your freezer or hosting memorable meals.</p>
<h4>Features:</h4>
<ul>
<li>Scotch Fillets</li>
<li>Porterhouse</li>
<li> Rump Steaks</li>
<li> Blade Steaks</li>
<li>Short RIbs</li>
<li> Diced Beef</li>
<li> BBQ Steaks</li>
<li>Stewing Steaks</li>
<li> Osso Bucco</li>
<li>Premium Beef Mince</li>
<li>Beef Sausages - Traditional and Gourmet</li>
<li>Rolled Roast</li>
<li>Silverside</li>
<li>Brisket</li>
<li>Soup Bones</li>
<li>Trim and Bones if requested</li>
<li>50 kg HCSW (Hot Carcass Side Weight, weight at processing)</li>
</ul>
<h4>Details:</h4>
<ul data-rte-list="default">
<li>
<p class=""><strong>Packaging:</strong> Vacuum-sealed for optimal freshness and convenience.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p class=""><strong>Storage:</strong> Store in your freezer upon delivery and consume within recommended timeframes for the best taste and texture.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="">Don’t miss out on this opportunity to experience the finest meats from Benbullen Speckle Park Meats. Order your Quarter Beast package today and discover the difference that passion, quality, and sustainability make in every bite.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/7893/">Benbullen Grass Fed Quarter Beast</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
