		<item>
		<title>A fair bit of speckle (40kg)</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/a-fair-bit-of-speckle-40kg/</link>
					<comments>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/a-fair-bit-of-speckle-40kg/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[farmerbutcher_t66bou]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 25 Jun 2024 03:26:22 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=7650</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p class="">Looking for a saving on our premium speckle park beef? Purchase a bulk amount of speckle park beef from one side of a processed beast. You will receive between 40kg of meat, in a wide variety of cuts.</p>
<p class="">These cuts include Brisket, Roasts, Corned beef/silverside, Eye fillet, Rib fillet, T Bone, Rump, Osso Bucco, Mince, Sausages, Steakettes, Diced beef, Ribs.</p>
<p class="">The roast and steak cuts may vary depending upon availability.  Part of our ethos isnose-to-tail eating with nothing going to waste, cuts available depend on what we have when your order is being cut and packed.  If you have a specific request please put it in the notes and we'll try our best. Trust us you will enjoy it!</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/a-fair-bit-of-speckle-40kg/">A fair bit of speckle (40kg)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/a-fair-bit-of-speckle-40kg/">A fair bit of speckle (40kg)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
