				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=7648</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p class="">This box includes 20kg of premium speckle park beef, enough to keep everyone in the family happy.</p>
<ul>
<li>2.5kg Primal steaks</li>
<li>2.5kg Secondary steaks (Round, Frying, schnitzels, Oyster etc)</li>
<li>4kg mince</li>
<li>3kg traditional sausages</li>
<li>1kg gourmet sausages</li>
<li>2 X 2.25kg roast – blade, round chuck or topside</li>
<li>1.5kg for slow cooking – a selection of osso bucco, diced chuck etc.</li>
<li>1kg Brisket and/or Beef Short Ribs</li>
<li>Housemade Sauces and salt</li>
<li>Beef Jerky</li>
</ul>
<p class="">The roast and steak cuts will vary depending upon availability.  Part of our ethos isnose-to-tail eating with nothing going to waste, cuts available depend on what we have when your order is being cut and packed.  If you have a specific request please put it in the notes and we'll try our best. Trust us you will enjoy it!</p>
